{"speciesId":407,"names":{"fr":"Roserade","es":"Roserade","en":"Roserade","ja":"ロズレイド"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It attracts prey with a sweet aroma, then downs it with thorny whips hidden in its arms."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"With the movements of a dancer, it strikes with whips that are densely lined with poison thorns."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"Each of its hands contains different toxins, but both hands can jab with near-fatal power."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"Its sweet aroma attracts prey. Then it spews poison. The more toxic it is, the sweeter its aroma."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Its sweet aroma attracts prey. Then it spews poison. The more toxic it is, the sweeter its aroma."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Ses mains contenant chacune des toxines différentes sont capables d’asséner de puissants coups."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Each of its hands contains different toxins, but both hands can jab with near-fatal power."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Ses mains contenant chacune des toxines différentes sont capables d’asséner de puissants coups."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Each of its hands contains different toxins, but both hands can jab with near-fatal power."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Luring prey with a sweet scent, it uses poison whips on its arms to poison, bind, and finish off the prey."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Luring prey with a sweet scent, it uses poison whips on its arms to poison, bind, and finish off the prey."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il attire ses proies grâce à son parfum, puis les empoisonne ou les étouffe à l’aide de ses bras vénéneux."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Atrae a sus presas con una dulce fragancia y usa sus cepas venenosas para atenazarlas y acabar con ellas."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Luring prey with a sweet scent, it uses poison whips on its arms to poison, bind, and finish off the prey."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"甘い 香りで 獲物を 誘い 両腕の 毒のムチを 使って 刺したり 締めたりして しとめる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Gracieux comme un danseur, il abat ses fouets ornés d’épines empoisonnées."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Se mueve como un bailarín y golpea con látigos repletos de púas venenosas."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"With the movements of a dancer, it strikes with whips that are densely lined with poison thorns."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"ダンサーのような 身のこなしで 毒の トゲが びっしりと 並んだ ムチを 操り 攻撃する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Il attire ses proies grâce à son parfum, puis les empoisonne ou les étouffe à l’aide de ses bras vénéneux."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Atrae a sus presas con una dulce fragancia y usa sus cepas venenosas para atenazarlas y acabar con ellas."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Luring prey with a sweet scent, it uses poison whips on its arms to poison, bind, and finish off the prey."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"甘い 香りで 獲物を 誘い 両腕の 毒のムチを 使って 刺したり 締めたりして しとめる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Gracieux comme un danseur, il abat ses fouets ornés d’épines empoisonnées."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Se mueve como un bailarín y golpea con látigos repletos de púas venenosas."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"With the movements of a dancer, it strikes with whips that are densely lined with poison thorns."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"ダンサーのような 身のこなしで 毒の トゲが びっしりと 並んだ ムチを 操り 攻撃する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Après avoir troublé les sens de ses adversaires avec le parfum exquis de ses fleurs, il les frappe violemment avec ses fouets ornés d’épines."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Aturde a los rivales con la fragancia de sus flores para luego azotarlos sin piedad con sus cepas espinosas."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"After captivating opponents with its sweet scent, it lashes them with its thorny whips."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"かぐわしい 花の 香りで 相手を 惑わせ いばらの ムチで 激しく 打ちつける。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Sa main gauche administre un poison lent, et la droite, un poison foudroyant. Les deux peuvent être fatals."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Las toxinas de la mano derecha son de efecto inmediato, y las de la izquierda, retardado. No obstante, ambas pueden ser letales."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"The poison in its right hand is quick acting. The poison in its left hand is slow acting. Both are life threatening."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"右手の 毒は 即効性。 左手の 毒は 遅効性。 どちらも 命に かかわるぞ。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"Hidden within the bouquet on each hand are thorned whips loaded with virulent poison. Roserade moves gracefully as it corners its prey and mercilessly lashes them with its whips."}],"varieties":[{"id":407,"moves":[{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"cut","learns":[[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[20,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"poison-sting","learns":[[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1],[24,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"pin-missile","learns":[[20,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"hyper-beam","learns":[[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11